---
title: yareli's press
layout: main
---

<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-4 md:grid-cols-8 gap-2">
  <div class="col-auto sm:col-span-2 flex flex-col flex-wrap">
    <div class="flex-1 w-full h-full p-2 border bc bg sm:mb-2">
      <h2 class="w-full text-sm font-bold uppercase fg-i bg-i p-1 mb-2">yareli's press</h2>
      <img class="w-16 sm:w-1/4 float-left mr-2 rounded-lg mb-2 sm:mb-0" src="/content/images/icon.jpg">
      <p class="type text-sm text-justify">
        hello... welcome to my personal blog and website. i write about video games,
        manga, personal, et. al. the site is mobile-friendly but is best experienced
        on desktop! please enjoy your stay, and thanks for stopping by.
        <br><br>
        <b><!--# views --></b> total site visits!
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="hidden sm:block flex-1 w-full h-full p-2 border bc bg">
      <h2 class="w-full text-sm font-bold uppercase fg-i bg-i p-1 mb-2">read me</h2>
      <p class="type text-sm text-justify">
        <b>yareli.</b> 21yo, any/all, black. graphic design undergraduate. depending
        on where u meet me online, i also go by frissyn, berrymyre, and alairaisover.
        <br><br>
        see more on the <a class="link type fg" href="/pages/about/">/about</a> page.
        <br>
        follow the site via <a class="link type fg" href="/posts.xml">/posts.xml</a> rss reader.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="col-auto sm:col-span-6 p-2 border bc bg">
    <div class="flex flex-col justify-center h-full">
      <div class="flex-none">
        <h1 class="w-full text-sm font-bold uppercase fg-i bg-i p-1 mb-2">Featured Post</h1>
      </div>

      <div class="flex-1">
        {% assign featured = collections.featuredPosts | first %}
        <img class="w-5/12 hidden sm:block float-left mr-3 ft-img" src="{{ featured.url }}{{ featured.data.meta.image }}" />
        <p class="type text-xs fg mb-2">{{ featured.date | date: "%b %d, %Y" }}</p>
        <h1 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold fg ">{{ featured.data.title }}</h1>
        <p class="type text-xs fg mb-2 sm:mb-2"><i>{{ featured.data.subtitle }}</i></p>
        <img class="w-5/12 block sm:hidden w-11/12 mx-auto mb-2 ft-img" src="{{ featured.url }}{{ featured.data.meta.image }}" />

        <div id="content" class="text-justify strip-content">
          {{ featured.content | truncatewords: 152 | replace: "<br>", " " }}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex-none mt-2">
        <a class="link text-sm type font-black uppercase" href="{{ featured.url }}">Read Full Post &gt;&gt;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="col-auto sm:col-span-6 p-2 border bc bg">
    <div class="flex flex-col justify-center h-full">
      <div class="flex-none">
        <h1 class="w-full text-sm font-bold uppercase fg-i bg-i p-1 mb-2">Latest Posts</h1>
      </div>

      {%- assign n = 0 -%}
      {%- assign posts = collections.post | reverse -%}
      <div class="flex-1 pr-1">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 grid-flow-row w-full pb-1 gap-4 w-full">
        {% for i in (0..6) %}
          {%- if posts[n].data.meta.featured %}{% assign n = n | plus: 1 %}{% assign i = i | minus: 1 %}{% continue %}{% endif -%}
          <div class="col-auto">
            <div class="flex flex-row w-full gap-x-2 sm:gap-x-3">
              <div class="flex-none">
                <img class="w-36 h-36 object-cover ft-img" src="{{ posts[n].url }}{{ posts[n].data.meta.image }}" />
              </div>
              <div class="flex-1">
                <div class="flex flex-col flex-wrap justify-center w-full h-full">
                  <div class="flex-auto">
                    <p class="type text-xs fg mt-4">{{ posts[n].date | date: "%b %d, %Y" }}</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex-auto">
                    <h1 class="text-md font-bold fg"><a  class="link" href="{{ posts[n].url }}">{{ posts[n].data.title }}</a></h1>
                    <p class="type text-xs fg"><i>{{ posts[n].data.subtitle }}</i></p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          {% assign n = n | plus: 1 -%}
        {%- endfor -%}

        <a class="link text-sm type font-black uppercase" href="/pages/archive">View Full Archive &gt;&gt;</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="col-auto sm:col-span-2 flex flex-col flex-wrap">
    <div class="flex-none w-full sm:h-1/3 p-2 border bc bg">
      <h2 class="w-full text-sm font-bold uppercase fg-i bg-i p-1 mb-2">site map</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-xs">
          <li>total site updates: <b><!--# updates format="true" --></b></li>
          <li>last site update: <b><!--# flastmod file="index.html" fmt="%b %d, %Y @ %hh:%mm %p" timezone="America/New_York" --></b></li>
          <li>view site source here: <b><a class="link" href="https://github.com/alittleyareli/alittleyareli">github</a></b></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>